---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title={`About ${site.name} | REALTOR® Flower Mound`} description="Meet Diego Alvarado — investor-turned-REALTOR® with Monument Realty serving Flower Mound and North DFW. Hablo Español.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero">
      <div class="headshot">
        <img src="/images/diego-alvarado.png" alt="Diego Alvarado, REALTOR®" width="800" height="1000" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Diego Alvarado</h1>
        <p style="font-size:1.15rem;max-width:36rem;">
          REALTOR® with {site.brokerage}, helping buyers, sellers, relocators, and investors
          across Flower Mound and the Grapevine Lake / North DFW suburbs. Hablo Español.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Work with Diego</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>From investor to REALTOR®</h2>
      <p>
        Diego’s path into real estate started on the investment side — deals, renovations,
        and operations — before he earned his Texas real estate license in April 2024
        (License #{site.license}). That sequence is why conversations include numbers,
        contingencies, and second-order risks, not just listing photos.
      </p>
      <h2>Who he works with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>First-time and move-up buyers comparing North DFW suburbs</li>
        <li>Sellers who want a calm, organized listing process</li>
        <li>Relocators coordinating from another city or time zone</li>
        <li>Investors evaluating rentals and longer-term holds</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Roots & languages</h2>
      <p>
        Originally from Argentina, Diego brings an international perspective and bilingual
        service in English and Spanish — so families can ask the real questions without
        translation friction.
      </p>
      <h2>How he works</h2>
      <p>
        Expect responsiveness, plain-language updates, and a practical vendor network for
        title, inspection, and project needs. No template fluff — a clear next step.
      </p>
      <h2>Brokerage & credentials</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name}, REALTOR® · Texas License #{site.license} · {site.brokerage}<br />
        {site.address.full}<br />
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> · <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
